{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8001_p", "source_sha256": "b31e5b17a252dd25f0af6e5473fc935d3d5c2ed6621d195fe620f2b77eab705f", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画で、\n静香はバーテンダーのテーマで撮影する）", "zh": "（在偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划中，\n静香以酒保为主题进行拍摄）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8002_015siz", "source_sha256": "4eec286cc47fe3c18976ed84e3766dd0aeb9fcc160dd793f6403d4b6a132abd7", "ja": "うーん……。やっぱり落ち着かないです。\nバーにも行ったことないのに、私にできるのか……。", "zh": "嗯……果然还是静不下心来。\n我连酒吧都没去过，真的能做好吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8003_p", "source_sha256": "fba89dc125b3fa3752bba3be06981311cee4957f2806489c50ded44ea6ce55b1", "ja": "そこはイマジネーションで補ってみよう！\n大人になってバーにいる自分を想像するんだ。", "zh": "这就用想象力来弥补吧！  \n想象一下自己长大后待在酒吧里的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8004_015siz", "source_sha256": "87c7e19689112ce05407b4a1d6f18ab2dd5f87ce88380101e6390019e9e655b1", "ja": "簡単に言いますけど、イメージするのって\n結構難しいんです。もう少しヒントがないと……。", "zh": "您说得倒轻松，可要在脑海里想象出来，其实挺难的。要是没有更多提示的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8005", "source_sha256": "e5bb5a85c23217125b4b65a28585d7206982aaeea0c36cc66abf3336d91393ea", "ja": "CMを見る", "zh": "观看广告", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8006", "source_sha256": "4686acb8a33ccb831757cb37decae8e6fb355f2ade8e89a2a1b7afbef9dd62fd", "ja": "照明を調整する", "zh": "调整灯光", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8007", "source_sha256": "c8906b762713e4a55efd376f4647762c1bb191aedfe76e2acb90ba9fe6e77ba8", "ja": "客になる", "zh": "当客人", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8100_p", "source_sha256": "c982dc0d7444a880460b3262d7bcf0de26e2bcf7c3fccea5005c773a8da08d17", "ja": "バーを舞台にしたCMもあるから、少しは想像の助けに\nなるかもしれないな。ちょっと見てみよう。", "zh": "因为还有以酒吧为舞台的广告，或许能帮你稍微想象一下。我们去看看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8101_015siz", "source_sha256": "51a4ed2e9913200f19998ca2700b83b5c57e04ba528e8a302e051d0125cc7c1e", "ja": "……なるほど。バーテンダーさんって、\n落ち着いてて、紳士的な感じなんですね。", "zh": "……原来如此。调酒师给人的感觉，\n很沉着冷静，又很有绅士风度呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8102_015siz", "source_sha256": "a1cfbc799507533ec5378ab44fb4cbd25469ec9b50fad390d8ebd903c7fbbc94", "ja": "あくまで静かに……。うん、掴めた気がします！\nありがとうございました。", "zh": "始终保持安静……嗯，我好像抓到感觉了！\n谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8200_p", "source_sha256": "de883fd7c82649f0d79fa6943a346742a9210b34251705f2f8a8973192bbf165", "ja": "バーは薄暗くて、特有の雰囲気があるからな。\nちょっと照明を落としてもらうようにしようか。", "zh": "酒吧本来就光线昏暗，有种独特的氛围嘛。  \n要不要请他们把灯光调暗一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8201_015siz", "source_sha256": "4c91bfafa7052573b179c92a99133c9b1890903f9d3f6490cd8815ffa14ed3c6", "ja": "い、いいですよ！　そんなことしなくても。\n私の想像力だけでもなんとかできます！", "zh": "不、不用了啦！用不着那么做的。\n光靠我的想象力，总能应付得来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8202_015siz", "source_sha256": "a5f8c4070272b29738664e51f49df2bc095647c1308ba2c1b18bbe38dc02b9f6", "ja": "私のお仕事ですから、そこで見ててください！\nよし。指導役のバーテンダーさんに話を聞かなきゃ！", "zh": "这是我的工作，所以请在那里看着我！\n好。得去问问负责指导的调酒师！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8300_p", "source_sha256": "e4080bff4ba174c963140cbedd1f0f59e5cc5f2ee8513868706c00f1aa5025de", "ja": "こうなったら……ここは俺が飲む！　静香はどんどん\nカクテルを作ってくれ！　実地経験に勝るものなしだ！", "zh": "既然这样……那就由我来喝！静香，你尽管不停地调制鸡尾酒吧！没有什么比亲身实践更有效了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8301_015siz", "source_sha256": "95c8db3efc769e79b1456a7c1578d0375a3409d1a2169e64e31433b47c7508c9", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっと！\n大人としてどうかと思いますけどっ！", "zh": "等、等一下！\n我觉得您这样实在有失成年人的体面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_8302_015siz", "source_sha256": "f63ff72a98aab32b4ef884a4c4e57f4aad7c51cdf7fd48d910f201fee82968c6", "ja": "はぁ、{$P$}には頼れないわ。\n自分でなんとかしなきゃ……。", "zh": "唉，看来不能指望{$P$}了。得靠自己想办法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
